<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Utimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur uwu uvaa Uburhu aka atsɛnge Utimoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Utimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Uti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur uwu uvaa Uburhu aka atsɛnge</para>
  <para style="mt1">Utimoti</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Utimoti uwu uvaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Uwɛrɛ awu ubvur uwu uvaa Uburhu aka atsɛnge Utimoti, ungwɛ̃nga ri imangmang. Unga atsɛng umgbɔ ri ivangyɛ unga aka awe ru ugborzĩ ru uteu Uroma ri ivang iyiki imashi itsernga, ri ivangyɛ unga aka abɔr ikpikpe ra amɛk aki 66-67 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Atsɛng ubvur ha amesuwe Utimoti na afituwe unga ugɛ unga abima ra asu ayetnum, nu ikɛi amina asunga na atɔ̃ itseryɛ Uburhu aka akorhe ri itsi Ukiristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ri inggbaashia, ubvur ha ufituwe Utimoti ugɛ unga amina asunga na amesuwe imesayɛ unga aka ayɛi akarhãrhã, ikɛi ugɛ unga abima ra ayetnum, na akpɛ̃ɛ̃ imesi igbɛrangwĩ. Ikɛi ubvur ha umesuwe unga imesa ri itsi inum iyiki imimasha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uburhu amashu ubvur ha nggu anggɔm nu ikeramɛn ugɛ Uteijee awuri itsũwũka unga ru ubɛn ikpũ iyiki ibewe na akũ unga azĩ ri iyɛrha afãnga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:18">4.18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ikpikpoi nu ififita <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1.3—2.13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imesa nu itsũwã <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2.14—4.5</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Arherhe ri itsi Uburhu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4.6-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4.19-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Ubvur uwurɛ udzeku umum, Uburhu, uner itser Ukiristo Uyesu ri ibibee Unum. Adena umum idze idũwã ibibemuwe urhɛ uku udze ri imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Uzĩ ru Utimoti, uze ungwɛ̃mum. Unum Utɛ nu Ukiristo Uyesu Uteijeemɛn ama adzaa ungo imimuta, nu atorh nu ididɔɔr.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ififita nu itar uwɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Umum itar uwɛɛ ru Unum, uwuruwi umum iki itɔ̃ itsernga, ru nyaka atokamum aki ikorhe, ri itɛna amɛn, ivang umum iki iyita ungo ru utsuu ra atenum ubɛn ivang ri ifɛn-Nummum. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Umum iki iyita anyĩngo, umum ibee inyã ungo, ngge itsú umum ima igɔmanggɔm. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Umum iyitu imangmango iyi idzidzɛrhe, iki inggbaashia iwe nggu ukokango Urhoyi nu uyango Uyuni, iyiriyɛ umum iki ihwɛng ungo nggu ngge. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu umum iyituwa ungo utɔ̃itser nggu izũwãyɛ Unum aka adzaa ungo ri ivangyɛ umum iki itsorhuwa ungo abok. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ubinkutsu, Unum asi idzaanga umɛn amɛn iwei, bɔr amɛn ijee, iyi ibibema nu ikpɔm itsi.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Nggee niba ugũo atsa ideku Uteijeemɛn, use atsa umum ru ugborzĩ. Bɔr uwe nggu umum ri ihwa ayetnum urhɔnga ri Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyɛrɛ, ri ijee Unum. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Unga afɔrh umɛn na ayisa umɛn iwe ru urhɛ uwuku usar. Asi iwea ubin ukpɔɔ umɛn iki ikorhe, bɔr awu ibibeeanga nu imimuta. Imimuta ha adzaa umɛn ru Ukiristo Uyesu ri ivang iyi inggbaashia idɔrhi itirhi, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>bɔr icɛrɛ aka adɛyiwa ngge ri idzidzeka uwuku ufɔrh umɛn, Ukiristo Uyesu, uwuku unyanguwe akpe na adɛyiwa urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ri Isarhe Iyiki Ize. <verse eid="2TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Nu Unum asɛng umum iwu uner udũwã, nu uner itser, nu ikɛi uner uwuku umesuwe ri Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyɛrɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Ngge itsu umum ihwa uverkpi umum iki iwe ru ukpɔ. Rimi hã umum isi igũmum atsa, ubinkutsu, umum ihwɛng unerwi umum iki iwe ru imangmang ru unga, ikɛi umum ihwɛng ugɛ unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzɛpa kishoo abinkɛ umum iki idzowe ru unga utsɛku unum hã.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Ungo udɔsa akarhãrhã imesa iyiki izeyɛ ungo uku ugũ ru umum nggu imangmang nu ibibema ru Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Udzɛu abin aka aze ha umbɔ aka aneka ake ru ungo. Udzɛu ake nggu iyiyike Ipfu Isarsatangge iki iwe ru umɛn.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Ungo uhwɛngo ugɛ ubɛn unera ra abĩ Uasiya aka adzipu undzingmbɔ ru umum. Ru umbɔ ha awu Ufaijerhu nu Uhamojeni.<verse eid="2TI 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Neke Uteijee ama adɛyiwe atorh ru aner iya Uonesiforu, ubinkutsu, inuma irhɛirhɛ unga aki atsuka umum iker, asi igũa atsa umum iki iwe ungwɛ̃ ugborzĩ. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, unga aka atsĩ ru Uroma, unga abeea umum akarhãrhã utsɛku unga aka akpo inyã umum. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Uteijee ama atsu ru unum ibiba Ukiristo Uonesiforu akpo atorh ru unga! Ungo uhwɛngo ikpũ itser irhɛirhɛ unga aka akorhuwa umum ru Uafisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Uner iwa uwuku urhurhika <optbreak/> uwu Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>A ungwɛ̃mum, udɛ̃ɛ̃ uker ri imimuta iyi Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Ra abinkɛ ungo uku ugũ ru umum iki irherhuwe ra asu abi ideka arhɛrhɛ, umesuwe ake ra abi idzidzɛrhe abirabɛ aka amɛ̃ imesuwe abɔɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Ubima ayetnum nggu umɛn ru nyaku uner iwa uwuku uze uwu Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Uner iwa uwuku uze asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ itser na atsuka itsinga ra arherhe upfung, ubinkutsu unga abee itɛne amɛn uteiya abi iwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Ru nyaka ha, ubɛn unera aba awe ru ununuka itĩtser nu itengasha, unga asi íkpoa itosa, unga aba asi idɔsunga ikpem ununuka ha. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Uner irham uwuku uker itser, unga awuri agbaashia ayɛi ugarh abin icang. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Ukaifɛrhkɔ ra abinkɛ umum iki irherhe, ubinkutsu Uteijee awuri idzaanga ungo ihwihwɛng ra abin akɛrɛ kishoo.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Uyita Uyesu Ukiristo, aka asok ra akpe, aka awu unang Udauda. Akɛrɛ awu Isarhe Iyiki Izemum <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>iki ihwa uver ngge. Umbɔ abow umum nggu inyãwã ugɛɛ uner ugbau, bɔr Arherhu-Num asi ibowke. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Nggee umum ibima abina kishoo ubinkutsu abirabɛ umbɔ aka asɛng ama akpo ififɔrh ha iki iwe ru Ukiristo Uyesu, nggu ikpikpoi iyi ugbagbaa.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Awu arherhe idzidzɛrhe ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Umɛn ĩba ikpemɛn nggu unga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">umɛn ikɛi iwuri ĩbɛkmɛn nggu unga.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Umɛn ĩba ibimumɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">umɛn ikɛi iwuri ighamɛn iyɛrhe nggu unga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Umɛn ĩba itsɛyimɛn unga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Unga ikɛi awuri itsɛyinga umɛn.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Umɛn ĩba ishimɛn ri imangmang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">unga awu uner imangmang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ubinkutsu, unga asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsɛyinga itsikamnga.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uner itserwi Unum aka abee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Udɛ̃ɛ̃ uyituwe umbɔ abin akɛrɛ. Utsɛrha umbɔ ra asu Unum ra arherhu uning ru irhɛm. Ashia ru ugarh, akpurha idakuwe abika akpeto. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Umina asungo nu utsu itsingo ru Unum nu uwe uwuruwi unga aka abee, uner itserwi aka ashia ra atsa na arhika ri idɛyiwe irhɛm idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Uneke irherhi irhɛm iyiki itãrhã iki ishingge ri iwei Unum, ubinkutsu abika atsu atsimbɔ ru ngge awuri iwe abika atoma azĩ adermbɔ ru Unum. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Imesambɔ iki isaki itɛ̃rhã ru nyaki inor. Ru umbɔ ha awu Uhimeniyu nu Ufirhetu, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>abika aneke utsĩndĩ idzidzɛrhe. Agɔr ugɛ isok ra akpe iki iwengge na idakuwe imangmang abɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Bɔr atarh idzin aki Unum hã adɛ̃ɛ̃ akeketake, nggu itsɛng iyiki inyapa umɔ igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee ahwɛnga abirabɛ aka awe abinga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Uva 16.5</ref></char>.</note>,&gt;&gt; nu &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aka agɔr agɛ unga awu uwu Uteijee awu ufang unga aneke ikorhe iyiki ibewe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Ri iya iki igɔng asi iwea abin uzinarhi nu uazurhfa ukpekũ, bɔr aki acucii nu aki abĩ aweke. Akɔɔ awe aki itser iyiki idzowe imor, akɔɔ awu aki itseryɛ iki ishingge ri imor. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Unera aba atsũwũka itsinga ri itser iyiki ibewe, unga awuri iwe ubinkpi umbɔ aka ikũ atɔ̃ itser iyiki idzowe imor. Unga awuri iwu atɛtɛn na adzɛu Uteiya aka ikũ unga atɔ̃ ubɛn itser iyiki ize.<figure style="fig" alt="Different kinds of vessels" file="wa04014b.tif" size="col" loc="2.21" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.21">Ikpũ andzoma</figure><verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Utĩɔ ri itser ikpona iyiki ibewe iyi iwɛdzɛm, bɔr ubee irhirhika, imangmang, ibibema, nu ididɔɔr, nggu abirabɛ aki afɛn-Num ru Uteijee ra amɛn aka atɛn. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Niba neke ubɛn ubin utomukpɔ ungo nggu uning uwuku utãrhã uwu ida ihwihwɛng, ubinkutsu ungo uhwɛngo umgbɔ usaki ikũ ifuw uba. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Uner itser Uteijee awu ufang asi ífupunga ifuw. Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, awu ufang unga awe ru inna ru ubɛn unera, awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ amesuka na awu uner idɔngamɛn. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Awu ufang unga angwɛ̃dzɛn na udzowe abika ikpɛ̃ unga itsũwã na afosa use Unum awuri nekuka umbɔ adzipa ra arhimmbɔ na adarh umbɔ ahwɛng idzidzɛrhe ha, <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>nu umbɔ awuri ibvui atsĩ ra amɛnmbɔ, na ashɔɔr ru unggurhi Undenggũ, aka idzur umbɔ adɔsu ubinkpi unga aka abee.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Idɔsu Unum ri inum iyiki imimasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Aze ungo uhwɛng ugɛ ri inum iyiki imasha ayetnum awuri iwe akarhãrhã. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Anera awuri ibema atsimbɔ, awuri ibemu uhwɛk, awuri iwu abika afufĩrhã, abika akwɛr ikɔ, abika ahong inyar, asi ídɔsumbɔ arherhe ateimbɔ, asi ítarmbɔ uwɛɛ, asi ísarmbɔ, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>awuri ishimbɔ ri ibibema, asi ítsũwũkumbɔ adɔka ra amɛnmbɔ, abika adakuwe atsok abɔɔ, asi íkpɔmmbɔ atsimbɔ, abi amɛn aka atsoo, asi íbemumbɔ iyiki ize, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>abika agha-dak, abika ashera amɛn, abi iberi itsi, abika abee igũibɛn anangmbɔ ibemu Unum, <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>abika adɔsa ra asu anera, bɔr atsɛyimbɔ ijeengge. Niba ukorhungo ubin nggu ikpũmbɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Ru umbɔ ha awu ikpũ abika akpo atsĩndĩ itsĩ ra aya anera na arhɛm akatsɛrh abika asheri itsoi, abirabɛ arhim aka awe ra atsimbɔ, nu ubɛn ikpũ ikponi iyiki ibewe iyiki ikũ amɛnmbɔ iyarhe. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Akatsɛrh abɛrɛ ha awu abirabɛ ubɛn unum umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ imimesa, bɔr asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩmbɔ ri ihwɛng idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Ru nyaka Ujeni nu Ujambra aka akpɛ̃ Umusa, rimi hã aner abɛrɛ aka akpɛ̃ idzidzɛrhe. Aner abɛrɛ akaifɛrhkɔ abin aka abewe. Aka agbambɔ ri imangmangmbɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Bɔr asi ízĩ adermbɔ, ubinkutsu anera kishoo awuri ihwɛngmbɔ aguggembɔ, ru nyaka anera aka ahwɛng agugge umbɔ Ujeni nu Ujambra.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu atsu Utimoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Bɔr ungo, uku udɔsungo kishoo imesamum, ikpũ ibibɛkmum, nu ubinkpi umum iki ibee ikorhe ri ibibɛkmum. Nu imangmangmum nu idɔng amɛnmum, nu ibibemamum, nu ibibimamum. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Umbi ahwɛngmbi uverkpi nu ayetnumkɛ aka akpo umum ru Uantakiya, nu Uikoniya nu Urhistira. Umum iki ibima ru uver ha. Rimi hã, Uteijee ashɔɔrka umum ra ake kishoo. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Idzidzɛrhe, ubɛn uwuku ubee ibibɛk iyi Unum aka abee ru Ukiristo Uyesu awuri ihwaa uver. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Bɔr abika abewe nu abika arhurhɛm awuri itoma agha inggbaashe, utirhi ri iyiki ibewe azĩ atsĩ nggaa iyiki ibewe. Awuri irhɛm abɔɔ nu awuri irhɛmbɔ umbɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Bɔr ungo, udɛ̃ɛ̃ ru ubinkpi ungo uku umesa nu udzowe imangmang ru ukpɔ, ubinkutsu ungo uhwɛngo abirabɛ ungo uku umesa ru umbɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Ungo uhwɛngo ugɛ udzur ri ivangyɛ ungo uku una uwu uwɛkuci nu uhwɛng usarkasar itsɛng Arherhu-Num. Akirakɛ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ amesuwa ungo utsĩndĩ uwuku ukpo ififɔrh ru ubok imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Kishoo itsɛng Arherhu-Num awu irhɛmyɛ unga aka atsu ra amɛn abika atsɛng ngge na aze ri imimesuwe nu itsitsɛrhe, nu igbigbisha ru igbaigba nu imimesuwe ri irhirhika, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>ngge itsú uner Unum ama adzuma agbisha akorhe ubɛn itser iyiki ize.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Umum idɛyiwa ungo ra asu Unum nu Ukiristo Uyesu, uwuruwi aka itsu uvau abi urhɛ nu abika akpe, uwuruwi aka ibvui aba awu Uyɛrhe ivangyɛ unga aka idzeka, <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>udzowe isarhe Arherhu-Num hã. Udɛ̃ɛ̃ udzɛu uko ivanga izengge uko ivanga isi izengge. Ugbishuwe anera, utsɛrha umbɔ, nu ufituwe umbɔ nggu idɔngamɛn akarhãrhã nu ungwɛ̃dzɛn nu imesuwe umbɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Ubinkutsu, ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ anera asi íbeembɔ igũ imesa iyi idzidzɛrhe. Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, awuri itsu atsimbɔ adɔsa ikpona amɛnmbɔ, awuri ikɔng abika amesuwe arhɛrhɛ adziira umbɔ na amesuwe abinkɛ atombɔ aka agho abee igigũ. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Umbɔ awuri idzipa atombɔ akpɛ̃mbɔ idzidzɛrhe, na atsu amɛnmbɔ ri igosha atsutson aka atãrhã. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Bɔr ungo, ukpɔm itsingo ri kishoo abina, ubima ra ayetnum, utɔ̃itser iyi uner udũwã Isarhe Iyiki Ize, utsufɛr itserngo iyi ugãrhã Unum.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Ubinkutsu awupuwe urhɛmum ru nyaku ugwiya idɛm-Num, ivanga iki ibangge umum iki ibɔre upfung. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Umum iki itĩtser ununuka uwuku uze. Umum iki imaamum ununuka ha, umum ina ikpɔmmum imangmang hã. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Icɛrɛ itosa irhirhika ngge idzɛu umum, iyiriyɛ Uteijee, uwuku urhika ri itsu uvau, aka idzaa umum ru unum hã unga aka iba. Unga asi ídzaanga umum ukpekũ, bɔr nggu kishoo abirabɛ aka atsu asumbɔ akarhãrhã abemi inyã idzidzekanga.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsar ukpumum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>A Utimoti, ubee udĩkpi ungo uku idɛ̃ɛ̃ ukorhe nu uba ru umum ifetem, <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>ubinkutsu Udima, aka abemu upfung ukpirɛ, aka nekuka umum aka adzek azĩã Utasarhonika. Ukirzen aka azĩã Ugarhatiya. Utitu aka azĩã Udarhmatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Irhuka ukpekũ awu nggu umum. Ukpo Umarku umbi aba nggu unga, ubinkutsu unga awuri iyika umum ri itsermum. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Umum iki idene Utikiku azĩã Uafisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Ivangyɛ ungo uku iba, ukũ nggu untamamum iki ineke ru ubok Ukarbu ru uteu Utoruwa. Nu ikɛi ukũ nggu abvurmum akɔrɔ, undzumunga abvur aki itsɛng hã.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Uarhekzanda uner unai uwɔrɔ akorhuwa umum iki ibewe akarhãrhã. Uteijee awuri ifasanga ubinkpi unga aka akorhe. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Ungo igango udzɛu itsingo ru uboknga, ubinkutsu unga awe ru igamtsak akarhãrhã nggu isarhamɛn.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki itirhi ikaa itsimum, unera asi itsiranga undzingmum, bɔr ubɛn unera abɔra umum iki iyikami. Unum ama aneke ivarha akɛrɛ ha ra atsimbɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Bɔr Uteijee adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum na adzaa umum iker, ngge ítsu umum ima idũwã kishoo isarhe ha nu kishoo atsen abi Uyahuda ama agũ ngge. Nu unga aka ashɔɔrka umum ra angwĩ utɛ̃rhĩmi. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Uteijee awuri ishɔɔrka umum ru ubɛn iyiki ibewe na awuri ishɔɔrka umum azĩ uku utɔɔ ri Iyɛrhe afã. Ru unga ikpikpoi iwe ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimasha ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Ughwea Ubiriskirha nu Uakirha nu aner iya Uonesiforu. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Uarastu asei ru Ukorinti, nu umum ineke Uturofimu ri irhãrhã ru Umirhetu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Ubee udĩkpi ungo uku uba ri nggimi ri ivang ighɛnga idɔrhi iwe. Uyaburhu nu Ufuden, nu Urhainu, nu Ukarhaudiya nu kishoo abika adɔsa aghwe ighwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Uteijee ama awe nggu ipfumbi, nu imimutanga ima iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
